---
layout: "main.webc"
title: "Home"
seoTitle: "Provision your entire stack directly from your CLI | Stripe Projects"
ogTitle: "Provision your entire stack directly from your CLI | Stripe Projects"
seoDesc: Set up hosting, databases, auth, AI, observability, analytics, and more from the CLI. Stripe Projects gives developers and coding agents a reliable way to provision real services, manage credentials, and keep track of usage across the stack."
ogDesc: Set up hosting, databases, auth, AI, observability, analytics, and more from the CLI. Stripe Projects gives developers and coding agents a reliable way to provision real services, manage credentials, and keep track of usage across the stack."
ogImage: "/assets/images/og/default.jpg"
ogImageAlt: ""
changefreq: "weekly"
---

<!--- Page --->
<div class="relative w-full">

    <!--- Header --->
    <header class="relative w-full flex items-center justify-center px-16 z-50 group/header">
        <helm-container class="relative pt-24 pb-12 flex items-center justify-center">
            <div data-header="logo" class="relative flex items-center h-40 gap-4">
                <icon-wordmark class="relative h-21 w-[174px] shrink-0"></icon-wordmark>
            </div>
        </helm-container>
    </header>

    <!--- Page contents --->
    <main id="main" class="group/main">

        <!--- Hero --->
        <helm-section class="relative z-20">
            <helm-container class="relative flex flex-col pt-24 sm:pt-48">
                <!--- Content --->
                <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center text-center md:px-16 mb-64 sm:mb-80">
                    <div class="mb-28 max-w-896 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                        <h1 data-hero="headline" class="relative text-[10vw]/100 min-[640px]:text-[9vw]/100 min-[768px]:text-64/100 tracking-tighter mb-18 max-w-640">
                            Provision your stack<br>from your CLI
                        </h1>
                        <p data-hero="description" class="text-16/150 sm:text-18 sm:text-18/150 text-content text-balance md:text-pretty">
                            Stripe Projects gives developers and coding agents a reliable way to provision services and manage credentials across the stack from the CLI. Set up hosting, databases, auth, AI, observability, analytics, and more.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <!--- CTAs --->
                    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 w-auto min-[448px]:grid-cols-2">
                        <!--- CTA --->
                        <div data-hero="cta" class="relative hidden min-[448px]:block">
                            <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center gap-8 px-24 h-48 bg-primary text-neutral-0 font-normal rounded-4 group hover:bg-primary-hover has-focus-visible:bg-primary-hover has-focus-visible:shadow-focus transition-all duration-250 cursor-pointer outline-none">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 12 12" class="w-16 h-16 mb-1">
                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M9.75 1.88h-7.5A1.13 1.13 0 0 0 1.13 3v6a1.13 1.13 0 0 0 1.12 1.13h7.5A1.1 1.1 0 0 0 10.88 9V3a1.1 1.1 0 0 0-1.13-1.12M2.25.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 0 3v6a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 12 9V3A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 9.75.75z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.57 3.38a.56.56 0 0 1 .8-.06l2.62 2.25a.56.56 0 0 1 0 .86L3.37 8.68a.56.56 0 1 1-.74-.86L4.76 6 2.63 4.18a.56.56 0 0 1-.06-.8M6 8.06a.56.56 0 0 1 .56-.56H9.2a.56.56 0 1 1 0 1.12H6.56A.56.56 0 0 1 6 8.06" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
                                </svg>
                                <span class="pb-2">
                                    Install CLI
                                </span>
                                <input data-checkbox="show-install" type="checkbox" name="stripe-cli" id="stripe-cli" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-0 cursor-pointer">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!--- CTA --->
                        <div data-hero="cta" class="relative hidden min-[448px]:block">
                            <link-btn size="48" color="outline" href="https://docs.stripe.com/stripe-projects">
                                <span slot="label">View docs</span>
                                <icon-arrowanimate slot="icon-right" @size="md" class=""></icon-arrowanimate>
                            </link-btn>
                        </div>
                        <!--- CTA --->
                        <div data-hero="cta" class="relative min-[448px]:hidden">
                            <link-btn size="48" color="primary" href="https://docs.stripe.com/stripe-projects">
                                <span slot="label">View docs</span>
                                <icon-arrowanimate slot="icon-right" @size="md" class=""></icon-arrowanimate>
                            </link-btn>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!--- Visual --->
                <div class="relative w-full">
                    <!--- Install --->
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex rounded-6 bg-foreground border border-edge -mb-6 pb-6 group-has-checked/main:rounded-12 group-has-checked/main:-translate-y-48 group-has-checked/main:-translate-x-8 group-has-checked/main:w-[calc(100%+1rem)] group-has-checked/main:h-[calc(100%+3.5rem)] transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out">
                        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full flex gap-8 h-48 px-8 overflow-hidden">
                            <!--- Left --->
                            <div class="relative flex items-center w-full min-w-0 h-32 mt-8 bg-highlight/50 rounded-6 shadow-inset-border">
                                <!--- Label --->
                                <div class="relative border-r border-headline/10 text-detail h-32 hidden sm:flex items-center justify-center pb-2 px-12"> 
                                    Install
                                </div>
                                <!--- Text --->
                                <div class="relative flex items-center w-full min-w-0 h-32 justify-between px-12 sm:px-8">
                                    <div data-install-text class="relative w-full font-mono text-15 truncate">
                                        brew install&nbsp;<span class="text-primary">stripe/stripe-cli/stripe</span>&nbsp;&&&nbsp;<span class="text-primary">stripe</span>&nbsp;plugin install&nbsp;<span class="text-primary">projects</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <!--- Copy button--->
                            <div class="relative flex items-center h-full shrink-0">
                                <button data-copy-install class="relative flex items-center justify-center gap-8 px-16 h-32 rounded-4 text-14 text-highlight bg-primary font-normal text-content group overflow-hidden hover:bg-primary-hover focus-visible:bg-primary-hover focus-visible:shadow-focus transition-all duration-200 ease-out cursor-pointer outline-none">
                                    <!--- Copy contents --->
                                    <div data-copy-install-copy class="relative flex items-center justify-center gap-8">
                                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="relative w-16 h-16">
                                            <path d="M13 0a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1.5v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5.25c0-.97.78-1.75 1.75-1.75a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25V14c0 .28.22.5.5.5h6.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1H6.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2zM6.5 1.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 2v9c0 .28.22.5.5.5H13a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5V2a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"/>
                                        </svg>
                                        <span class="relative pb-1">Copy</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <!--- Copied contents --->
                                    <div data-copy-install-copied class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center gap-8 translate-y-32 opacity-0 invisible scale-75">
                                        <div data-copy-checked class="relative w-16 h-16 bg-highlight rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
                                            <icon-check @size="8" @weight="strong" ></icon-check>
                                        </div>
                                        <span class="relative pb-1">Copied</span>
                                    </div>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!--- Graphics --->
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center -ml-16 w-[calc(100%+2rem)] py-8 px-8 sm:py-24 min-[48rem]:py-48 md:py-96 sm:px-24 sm:ml-0 sm:w-full bg-foreground overflow-hidden sm:w-full sm:rounded-6">
                        <!--- Wave --->
                        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none">
                            <img src="/assets/images/home/wave-fallback.jpg" alt="" width="2528" height="1580" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full flex h-full object-cover object-center">
                            <div data-js-target="nouveau-bloom-wave" class="relative w-full h-full" data-position-x="500" data-position-y="100" data-blur="0" data-camera-zoom="1.5" data-wave-rotation="-85" data-color-offset="0" data-dither-gradient="2" data-dither-scale="3" data-dither-full="true"></div>
                            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full border border-headline/15 rounded-6 z-10"></div>
                        </div>
                        <!--- UI Content --->
                        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-600 z-10 overflow-hidden">
                            <!--- Terminal --->
                            <div data-hero="terminal" class="relative flex w-full p-6 bg-linear-to-b from-highlight/20 to-highlight/10 border border-highlight/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-12 shadow-xl overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="relative w-full h-full bg-linear-to-b from-highlight to-highlight/80 rounded-6 shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
                                    <!--- Terminal window controls --->
                                    <div aria-hidden="true" class="relative shrink-0 flex items-center justify-between w-full h-32 border-b border-headline/4">
                                        <!--- Left --->
                                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                                            <div class="flex gap-4 px-8">
                                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-headline/4 shadow-inset-border hover:bg-[#E85E59] transition duration-200 ease-out"></div>
                                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-headline/4 shadow-inset-border hover:bg-[#EFC334] transition duration-200 ease-out"></div>
                                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-headline/4 shadow-inset-border hover:bg-[#5CBC58] transition duration-200 ease-out"></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-detail text-14"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <!--- Terminal contents --->
                                    <div class="relative w-full h-full font-mono text-12 min-[448px]:text-14 sm:text-16 px-16 pt-10 pb-24 whitespace-nowrap tracking-tighter sm:tracking-normal">
                                        <div class="relative w-full pb-6">
                                            <span class="text-detail">›</span>
                                            <span><span>stripe projects</span> <span>add</span> <span data-hero-type>vercel/hosting</span></span>
                                            <icon-logo class="w-12 text-primary -translate-y-2 h-auto inline-block animate-carat -ml-6"></icon-logo>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative w-full text-detail pb-6">
                                            ○ Provisioning <span>service</span><span data-hero-type-dots>...</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative pb-6 text-detail">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[0.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[1em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<div class="relative inline-block w-[1em] h-[1em] sm:w-[0.75em] sm:h-[0.75em] mr-[1ch] translate-y-[0.125em] sm:translate-y-0 shrink-0 text-[#006F3A]"><icon-check size="var"></icon-check></div>Configuration complete</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative pb-6 text-detail">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[1.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[2em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><div class="relative inline-block w-[1em] h-[1em] sm:w-[0.75em] sm:h-[0.75em] mr-[1ch] translate-y-[0.125em] sm:translate-y-0 shrink-0 text-[#006F3A]"><icon-check size="var"></icon-check></div>Credentials generated &amp; synced</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative w-full text-headline pb-6">
                                            <div class="inline-block w-[1ch] h-[1ch] bg-[#006F3A] rounded-full mr-[1ch]"></div><span class="text-[#006F3A]">Provider</span> <span>ready</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative pb-6">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[0.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[1em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><div class="relative inline-block w-[1em] h-[1em] sm:w-[0.75em] sm:h-[0.75em] mr-[1ch] translate-y-[0.125em] sm:translate-y-0 shrink-0 text-[#006F3A]"><icon-check size="var"></icon-check></div>Created</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative pb-6">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[1.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[2em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><div class="relative inline-block w-[1em] h-[1em] sm:w-[0.75em] sm:h-[0.75em] mr-[1ch] translate-y-[0.125em] sm:translate-y-0 shrink-0 text-[#006F3A]"><icon-check size="var"></icon-check></div>Added 4 environment variables in <span class="text-primary">.env</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[1.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[2em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><div class="relative inline-block w-[1em] h-[1em] sm:w-[0.75em] sm:h-[0.75em] mr-[1ch] translate-y-[0.125em] sm:translate-y-0 shrink-0 text-[#006F3A]"><icon-check size="var"></icon-check></div>Modified <span class="text-primary">.projects/vault/vault.json</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative w-full pb-6 mt-6">
                                            <span class="text-detail">›</span>
                                            <span><span>stripe projects</span> <span>upgrade</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="relative w-full text-detail pb-6">
                                            ○ Select a service
                                        </div>
                                        <div data-tier="0" class="relative pb-2">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[0.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[1em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><span data-tier-name class="text-primary">Starter ‹</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div data-tier="1" class="relative pb-2">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[1.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[2em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><span data-tier-name class="text-detail">Hobby</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div data-tier="2" class="relative">
                                            <div class="absolute -top-[1.25em] left-[2ch] w-[1ch] h-[2em] border-l border-b border-neutral-200"></div>
                                            <span class="inline-block pl-[4ch]"><span data-tier-name class="text-detail">Pro</span></span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </helm-container>
        </helm-section>

        <!--- Logos --->
        <helm-section class="relative z-10 pt-32 sm:pt-16 pb-36 md:pb-0 overflow-hidden">
            <helm-container class="relative flex md:h-64">
                <div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 md:grid-cols-6 w-full items-center justify-center gap-16 sm:gap-0">
                    <div class="relative sm:pb-8 md:pb-0 col-span-2 sm:col-span-5 md:col-span-1 flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start uppercase text-detail text-12 tracking-widest shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap">
                        Launch providers
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-vercel data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-vercel>
                        <logo-railway data-logo-wall="2" class="absolute h-40 w-auto shrink-0 translate-y-48 opacity-0 invisible"></logo-railway>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-supabase data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-supabase>
                        <logo-posthog data-logo-wall="2" class="absolute h-40 w-auto shrink-0 translate-y-48 opacity-0 invisible"></logo-posthog>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-runloop data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-runloop>
                        <logo-planetscale data-logo-wall="2" class="absolute h-40 w-auto shrink-0 translate-y-48 opacity-0 invisible"></logo-planetscale>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-turso data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-turso>
                        <logo-chroma data-logo-wall="2" class="absolute h-40 w-auto shrink-0 translate-y-48 opacity-0 invisible"></logo-chroma>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-clerk data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-clerk>
                        <logo-neon data-logo-wall="2" class="absolute h-40 w-auto shrink-0 translate-y-48 opacity-0 invisible"></logo-neon>
                    </div>
                    <!--- Mobile only --->
                    <div class="relative flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-railway data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-railway>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-posthog data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-posthog>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-planetscale data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-planetscale>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-chroma data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-chroma>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative flex sm:hidden items-center justify-center">
                        <logo-neon data-logo-wall="1" class="relative h-40 w-auto shrink-0"></logo-neon>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </helm-container>
        </helm-section>

        <!--- Content --->
        <helm-section class="relative md:pb-64 z-10" style="padding-top: 80px;">
            <helm-container class="relative text-pretty flex flex-col gap-16">
                <!--- Headline --->
                <h2 class="text-28/110 sm:text-36/110 tracking-[-0.0375em] text-headline text-center">
                    Code generation got fast. Infrastructure didn’t.
                </h2>
                <p class="text-16 sm:text-18 text-content" style="max-width: 65%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
                    Agents write code fast, but they still need real services and real credentials to run it. Developers spend hours signing up for accounts, copying credentials, and configuring services by hand. Stripe Projects replaces that setup with a single command, without replacing the tools you already use.
                </p>
            </helm-container>
        </helm-section>

        <!--- Content --->
        <helm-section class="relative pt-64 pb-32 md:pt-64 md:pb-64 z-10">
            <helm-container class="md:grid md:grid-cols-2 items-center relative text-pretty">
                <!--- Content col --->
                <div class="relative flex flex-col items-start text-16 sm:text-18/150 text-content pr-80">
                    <h2 class="text-headline text-28/110 sm:text-36/110 tracking-[-0.0375em] mb-16">
                        Automate building your stack
                    </h2>
                    <p class="md:mb-24">
                        Add the services your app needs from the CLI—or let an agent do it. Stripe Projects provisions resources in provider accounts you own and stores credentials in your secret store. Every command is deterministic and auditable, so the same inputs produce the same result. Your project configuration stays portable, reviewable, and ready to deploy.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <!--- Commands col -->
                <div class="relative hidden md:block pb-6">
                    <div class="sticky top-48 w-full flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-6 border p-4" style="background:#111118;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08)">
                        <!--- Terminal title --->
                        <div class="relative w-full flex items-center justify-between px-4">
                            <div class="relative flex gap-4 shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"></div>
                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"></div>
                                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15)"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-14 pb-2 shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55)">
                                Stripe Projects commands
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-38 shrink-0"></div>
                        </div>
                        <!--- CLI command --->
                        <button data-copy-cli="brew install stripe/stripe-cli/stripe" data-container-hover-follow class="relative w-full h-64 p-1 rounded-4 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer text-left outline-none focus-visible:shadow-focus transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05)">
                            <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-3 border border-transparent group-hover:border-neutral-0/20 transition-all duration-400" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
                                <div class="relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-between rounded-3 transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out group-hover:bg-white/5">
                                    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center pl-16 gap-4">
                                        <a href="https://docs.stripe.com/stripe-cli/install#install" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-4 text-12 hover:underline" style="color:#e2e4ff">Install Stripe CLI<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="w-10 h-10 shrink-0"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M13 3.75a.75.75 0 0 0-.75-.75h-6.5a.75.75 0 0 0 0 1.5h4.69L2.22 12.72a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06L11.5 5.56v4.69a.75.75 0 0 0 1.5 0v-6.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg></a>
                                        <div class="font-mono text-14 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:!text-neutral-0" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92)">
                                            brew install stripe/stripe-cli/stripe
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="relative flex items-center shrink-0 pr-12">
                                        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-32 h-32 bg-transparent overflow-hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)">
                                            <div data-copy-cli-default class="flex items-center justify-center">
                                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="relative w-14 h-14 shrink-0"><path d="M13 0a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1.5v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5.25c0-.97.78-1.75 1.75-1.75a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25V14c0 .28.22.5.5.5h6.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1H6.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2zM6.5 1.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 2v9c0 .28.22.5.5.5H13a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5V2a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"/></svg>
                                            </div>
                                            <div data-copy-cli-clicked class="absolute flex items-center justify-center translate-y-24 scale-75 opacity-0 invisible">
                                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="relative w-14 h-14 shrink-0"><path d="M13.78 4.22a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.25 7.25a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 0L2.22 9.28a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06L6 10.94l6.72-6.72a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 0z"/></svg>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </button>
                        <!--- CLI command --->
                        <button data-copy-cli="stripe plugin install projects" data-container-hover-follow class="relative w-full h-64 p-1 rounded-4 overflow-hidden group cursor-pointer text-left outline-none focus-visible:shadow-focus transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05)">
                            <div class="relative w-full h-full rounded-3 border border-transparent group-hover:border-neutral-0/20 transition-all duration-400" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03)">
                                <div class="relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-between rounded-3 transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out group-hover:bg-white/5">
                                    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center pl-16 gap-4">
                                        <div class="text-12 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:!text-neutral-0" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)">Install Stripe Projects</div>
                                        <div class="font-mono text-14 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:!text-neutral-0" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92)">
                                            stripe plugin install projects
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="relative flex items-center shrink-0 pr-12">
                                        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center w-32 h-32 bg-transparent overflow-hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-400 ease-in-out" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)">
                                            <div data-copy-cli-default class="flex items-center justify-center">
                                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="relative w-14 h-14 shrink-0"><path d="M13 0a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1.5v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5.25c0-.97.78-1.75 1.75-1.75a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25V14c0 .28.22.5.5.5h6.5a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5v-1H6.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2zM6.5 1.5A.5.5 0 0 0 6 2v9c0 .28.22.5.5.5H13a.5.5 0 0 0 .5-.5V2a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5z"/></svg>
                                            </div>
